        "answer": {
          "short": "In table order: $-\\frac12,-1,-2,-4,*,4,2,1,\\frac12$.\n\nThe star marks an undefined value because division by zero is undefined.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}h(-4)&=\\frac{2}{-4}=-\\frac12\\\\h(-2)&=\\frac{2}{-2}=-1\\\\h(-1)&=\\frac{2}{-1}=-2\\\\h\\left(-\\frac12\\right)&=\\frac{2}{-\\frac12}=-4\\\\h\\left(\\frac12\\right)&=\\frac{2}{\\frac12}=4\\\\h(1)&=\\frac21=2\\\\h(2)&=\\frac22=1\\\\h(4)&=\\frac24=\\frac12\\end{align*}$$\n\nAt $x=0$, the expression $\\frac{2}{0}$ is undefined, so the supplied star remains.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
